Output assets/help.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 680
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type 'sh docs/vhs/setup-demo.sh && export PATH=/tmp/msm-vhs-bin:$PATH PS1="$ " && cd /tmp/msm-vhs-demo && clear'
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Type "msm --help"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
